    "text": "<p>A sample of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CaCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>MgCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> weighed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.21</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> is ignited to constant weight of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.152</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>. The composition of the mixture is:</p><p>(Given molar mass in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CaCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><msub><mi>MgCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mn>84</mn></math>)</p>",
